      "text": "The workflow identifies an ongoing CUDA dependency issue. This attempt extends its existing exact-version installation workaround to libnvidia-cfg1.",
      "basis": "source",
      "evidence": [
        "call_b2c53f8ef3fb461a94479bf50e1da7c2",
